# Nuvema Town (a quiet seaside village where journeys begin, the professor's lab at its edge): a warm flute tune in
# G major over strings, a harp turning slowly like a page and a soft bass. At night an ocarina takes the tune, slower.
# Original composition for this game (plan 22 · U10).
